 "narr": {
  "Aqua HK": "W32 users 3,409 (-14.5% YoY) with 184 GA4 bookings (-3.2% YoY); conversion rate 5.4% vs 4.8% LY. Google delivered 49 bookings at HK$173 CPA; Meta 11 at HK$669. Google had not published modelled store visits for this week when the data was pulled, so the latest point on the walk-in panel understates the true figure.",
  "Hutong HK": "W32 users 3,051 (+4.1% YoY) with 292 GA4 bookings (+27.5% YoY); conversion rate 9.6% vs 7.8% LY. Google delivered 22 bookings at HK$306 CPA; Meta 15 at HK$295. Google had not published modelled store visits for this week when the data was pulled, so the latest point on the walk-in panel understates the true figure.",
  "The Chinese Library": "W32 users 1,800 (+34.5% YoY) with 138 GA4 bookings (+35.3% YoY); conversion rate 7.7% vs 7.6% LY. Google delivered 34 bookings at HK$97 CPA; Meta 6 at HK$1,076. Google had not published modelled store visits for this week when the data was pulled, so the latest point on the walk-in panel understates the true figure.",
  "Cantina": "W32 users 1,507 (+37.4% YoY) with 83 GA4 bookings (+76.6% YoY); conversion rate 5.5% vs 4.3% LY. Google delivered 15 bookings at HK$213 CPA; Meta 7 at HK$356. Google had not published modelled store visits for this week when the data was pulled, so the latest point on the walk-in panel understates the true figure.",
  "Dim Sum Library": "W32 users 997 (-5.4% YoY) with 128 GA4 bookings (-22.4% YoY); conversion rate 12.8% vs 15.7% LY. Google delivered 41 bookings at HK$29 CPA; Meta 4 at HK$276.",
  "Shiro Pacific Place": "W32 users 682 (-27.1% YoY) with 81 GA4 bookings (-21.4% YoY); conversion rate 11.9% vs 11.0% LY. Google delivered 74 bookings at HK$57 CPA; Meta 17 at HK$353. Google had not published modelled store visits for this week when the data was pulled, so the latest point on the walk-in panel understates the true figure.",
  "Shiro Central": "W32 users 1,320 with 81 GA4 bookings; conversion rate 6.1%. New in 2026, so there is no like-for-like last year. Google delivered 74 bookings at HK$57 CPA; Meta 17 at HK$353. Google had not published modelled store visits for this week when the data was pulled, so the latest point on the walk-in panel understates the true figure."
